   "html": "<div layer-name=\"Page\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;padding:32px;flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;min-height:0\">\n  <div layer-name=\"Artboard Header\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--spacing-xs)\">\n    <div layer-name=\"Artboard Title\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:22px;font-weight:var(--font-weight-semibold);line-height:28px;color:var(--color-canvas-label-title);white-space:nowrap\">Share sheet</div>\n    <div layer-name=\"Type and File\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-callout);font-weight:var(--font-weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading-callout);color:var(--color-canvas-label-body);white-space:nowrap\">ShareLink · Trips/TripBuilderView.swift (toolbar Share), Shell/SidebarView.swift (context menu), Spot/SpotHeaderView.swift</div>\n    <div layer-name=\"Job\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-body);font-weight:var(--font-weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading-body);color:var(--color-canvas-label-title);max-width:900px\">The system share popover. A trip is shared as an .iter file; a spot as an Apple Maps link.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div layer-name=\"Content\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start\">\n    <div layer-name=\"Notes\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:var(--spacing-md);align-items:flex-start\">\n      <div layer-name=\"Note / System UI\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--spacing-xs);padding:var(--spacing-md);flex-shrink:0;width:340px;background:var(--color-canvas-note-background);border:1px solid var(--color-canvas-note-border);border-radius:var(--radius-control)\">\n        <div layer-name=\"Note Title\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-subheadline);font-weight:var(--font-weight-semibold);line-height:var(--leading-subheadline);color:var(--color-canvas-note-text)\">System UI</div>\n        <div layer-name=\"Note Body\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-subheadline);font-weight:var(--font-weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading-subheadline);color:var(--color-canvas-note-text)\">The share popover is macOS-owned and its destinations depend on the Mac. Drawn as a simplified stand-in; the icon tiles are placeholders (named \"App Icon (swap)\").</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
